# 依赖与缓存(避免构建上下文过大)
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.vite
*.log

# 构建产物(镜像内会重新构建)
**/dist
installer/app/static
installer/*.egg-info

# 运行时数据
installer/userhub.db
installer/workspace

# 杂项
.git
.github
docs
scripts
Makefile
docker-compose.yml
*.md

# Dockerfile-cli 专用: 离线文件/VM 镜像/inventory 不打包进 CLI 镜像
# (CLI 镜像只含源码; 离线文件经卷挂载或 fetch-offline-files.sh 下载; inventory 含集群凭证, 运行时生成)
deployments/offline-files
deployments/virtual-machine
deployments/kubespray/inventory
deployments/kubespray/kubespray/venv
